传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":8,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-63cf1d5bfce971887c22","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-d26728c67b5d387a3a2a","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：葛洪所记，近为惑众；其书文颇行世，故撮取数事，载之篇末也。神仙之术，讵可测量？臣之臆断，以为“惑众”，所谓夏虫不知冷冰耳！","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-67353aa6389e77079b41","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-8cc376b89b26d3fec7c2","layer":"pei","quote":"曾从吴主别到洌洲，还，遇大风，百官船多没；仙公船亦沉沦，吴主甚怅恨","attribution":"裴注·抱朴子","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":36,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-c46772971e6229b68490","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-8cc376b89b26d3fec7c2","layer":"pei","quote":"明日使人钩求公船，而登高以望焉。久之，见公步从水上来，衣履不沾，而有酒色。既见而言曰：‘臣昨侍从而伍子胥见请，暂过设酒，忽忽不得，即委之。’","attribution":"裴注·抱朴子","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":70,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
